{"headword":"חָרוֹן","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m. (burning of) anger (</strong>cf. Lag<sup>BN 204 Anm.</sup> <strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 7:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.7.12\">Ez 7:12</a> + 2 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲרוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 25:4\" href=\"/Numbers.25.4\">Nu 25:4</a> + 33 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲרוֹנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 7:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.7.14\">Ez 7:14</a> (Co <span dir=\"rtl\">חרון</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲרוֹנוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 2:5\" href=\"/Psalms.2.5\">ψ 2:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲרֹנְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:7\" href=\"/Exodus.15.7\">Ex 15:7</a>; pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲרוֹנֶי֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:17\" href=\"/Psalms.88.17\">ψ 88:17</a>;—always of God’s anger (v. note, infr.), <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲרוֹן אף</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:12\" href=\"/Exodus.32.12\">Ex 32:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 25:4\" href=\"/Numbers.25.4\">Nu 25:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:14\" href=\"/Numbers.32.14\">32:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:26\" href=\"/Joshua.7.26\">Jos 7:26</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 13:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.13.18\">Dt 13:18</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 28:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.28.18\">1 S 28:18</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:26\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.26\">2 K 23:26</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.11\">2 Ch 28:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.13\">13</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.10\">29:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 30:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.30.8\">30:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:14\" href=\"/Ezra.10.14\">Ezr 10:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 11:9\" href=\"/Hosea.11.9\">Ho 11:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:6\" href=\"/Nahum.1.6\">Na 1:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:2\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.2\">Zp 2:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:8\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.8\">3:8</a